Roadmap
=======

* Basic: Linear Regression, Linear Classifier, SVM, Softmax, Perceptron, MLP
* CNN: LeNet-5, AlexNet, VGG, GoogLeNet, ResNet
* Object Detection: R-CNN, Fast R-CNN, Faster R-CNN, YOLO v1/v2/v3, SSD, FPN, Mask R-CNN
* Segmentation: FCN, U-Net, U-Net++, Stacked U-Net, CUNet
* Sequence Models: RNN, Bi-RNN, LSTM, GRU, Character-RNN
* Sequence-to-Sequence: Encoder–Decoder / Seq2Seq, NMT, Attention
* NLP: Word2Vec Skip-gram, CBOW, GloVe, BERT, XLNet
* Generative Models: Autoencoder, VAE, GAN, Conditional GAN, CycleGAN, Progressive GAN, Style-based Generator
